;; Scene: the lit isometric farm diorama (spec §13, art direction in the phase 3-6 plan).
;; Read-only with respect to the sim: reads state, never writes memory below the framebuffer,
;; never calls the sim RNG (visual randomness = $noise of tile index / state seed / time).
;;
;; World: tile (tx, ty) covers x in [16tx, 16tx+16), y in [16ty, 16ty+16), ground z = 0; the
;; 8x8 board sits on a raised slab (front side faces visible); the owned grid is the top-left
;; grid x grid square. Behind the slab: a meadow backdrop, a two-lane dirt road along y = -17..-2 that
;; runs up-screen into the hills at the horizon (trucks drive it), a sky with sun and clouds.
;;
;; Fit ($scene_fit): the viewport rect (Task 4 layout; default = framebuffer minus a top and
;; bottom margin) must hold the owned grid, grown to include the selected plot when that lies
;; outside it (n x n tiles, + a quarter tile across, + 2 tiles of
;; height for tall models); hw = largest integer that fits (4..64), centred. The wild ring and
;; the rest of the 8x8 slab spill past it. Horizon = 1 tile above the slab's back corner but
;; at least fb_h / 5 (when the farm leaves room), so the sky never vanishes in landscape.
;;
;; Draw order ($scene_draw): sky gradient -> sun -> clouds -> hills -> meadow props behind the
;; road -> road + trucks (clipped at the horizon) -> props left of the slab -> slab sides ->
;; 64 ground tiles -> shadow pass -> object pass (back to front by tx+ty, fences around the
;; owned square) -> weather particles -> hover / selection -> ripe badges + sparkle.
;; Season / weather looks: palette grade via $tint_c/$tint_a (21_draw.wat), per-look sky,
;; meadow, hill and ground colour tables, snow on ROOF-flagged model parts in winter.
;; Motion (cloud drift, rain, flashes, sparkle, sails, smoke, sway) depends only on the time set
;; by $scene_time; with $flag_reduced = 1 the time is forced to 0 and particles are skipped, so
;; the frame no longer depends on time at all.
;;
;; Data: model table 0x6800 (generated by tools/gen-models.mjs, format documented there),
;; misc tables at $SCD = 0x7600 (below).

(global $flag_reduced (mut i32) (i32.const 0))
(global $sel_tile (mut i32) (i32.const -1))
(global $hover_tile (mut i32) (i32.const -1))
(global $vp_x (mut i32) (i32.const 0))
(global $vp_y (mut i32) (i32.const 0))
(global $vp_w (mut i32) (i32.const 0))
(global $vp_h (mut i32) (i32.const 0))
(global $sc_time (mut i32) (i32.const 0))
(global $sc_t (mut i32) (i32.const 0))      ;; effective animation time (0 under reduced motion)
(global $sc_g (mut i32) (i32.const 4))
(global $sc_hz (mut i32) (i32.const 0))     ;; horizon screen y
(global $sc_seed (mut i32) (i32.const 0))
(global $sc_sea (mut i32) (i32.const 0))
(global $sc_wx (mut i32) (i32.const 0))
(global $mcond (mut i32) (i32.const 1))     ;; model condition mask (see gen-models.mjs)
(global $rot (mut i32) (i32.const 0))       ;; 1 = rotting hue remap
(global $sway (mut i32) (i32.const 0))
(global $cur_p (mut i32) (i32.const 0))
(global $tr_x (mut i32) (i32.const 0))
(global $tr_y (mut i32) (i32.const 0))
(global $tr_w (mut i32) (i32.const 0))
(global $tr_h (mut i32) (i32.const 0))
(global $MODEL_ADDR i32 (i32.const 0x6800))
(global $SCD i32 (i32.const 0x7600))

